INTERPRETATION
The launcher exposes a PID namespace whose process-local numeric PID does not
index the mounted /proc tree. Lean's IO.appPath queried /proc/<numeric-pid>/exe
and received ENOENT. The compatibility shim retries only that failed query as
/proc/self/exe. The final preflight uses the non-logging shim.
